MOSELEY'S LAW
X-ray frequency reveals the atomic number

Henry Moseley (1887–1915)

√f = a (Z − b)

  f  : X-ray frequency          (Hz)
  a  : proportionality constant
  Z  : atomic number            (proton count)
  b  : screening constant

